al ships and more.\n\nIncludes:\nA twelve mission story based campaign covering your first tour of duty on the front lines\nMultiplayer to test your skills against other pilots\nSurvival/horde challenge mode with online leaderboard\nTutorial\nPractice mode\n\nStarfighter Arduxim requires a gamepad, joystick or HOTAS. Controls are fully customisable.", "short_description": "Strap into the cockpit of your Arduxim and take on enemy starships in this first-person tactical space shooter. Navigate through dangerous ice crystal fields, take hyper gates to other systems, take on enormous capital ships and more.\n\nRequires a gamepad, joystick or HOTAS. Controls are fully customisable."}]}, "developer_name": "Fulby Technologies", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.fulby.tech/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.fulby.tech/terms", "publisher_name": "Fulby Technologies", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.fulby.tech/starfighter-arduxim", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": null, "genres": ["ACTION", "SIMULATION", "SHOOTER", "ARCADE", "FIGHTING"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["GAMEPAD"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER", "MULTI_USER"], "id": "3150371118624548"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162716_203196756889135_6236833593771950080_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Pqf62pC4jFkQ7kNvwFvV9FB&_nc_oc=Adm1rfw9itV-ahhlyJnR6bDYaMktzO10gdEl5ZPBolw7k-3085l3h2QwvJ9f6UL9byI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.co